=== ruff
--- ruff 
analyze 	run analysis over Python source code
check 	run Ruff on the given files or directories
clean 	clear any caches in the current directory and any subdirectories
config 	list or describe the available configuration options
format 	run the Ruff formatter on the given files or directories
help 	print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
linter 	list all supported upstream linters
rule 	explain a rule (or all rules)
server 	run the language server
version 	display Ruff's version
--- ruff check --fi
--fix 	apply fixes to resolve lint violations
--fix-only 	apply fixes to resolve lint violations, but don't report on, or exit non-zero for, leftover violations
--fixable=	list of rule codes to treat as eligible for fix
--- ruff check --output-format 
